 Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"5\" data-bs-slide-to=\"5\"></a></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                                <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Долгунча: пьесалар, интермедиялар</b></h5>\n                                <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                                    <i>Card Subtitle</i>\n                                </h6>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">В сборник включены пьесы, написанные и поставленные в разные годы на сценах театров республики</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/26180?returnTo=%2Fto-readers%2Fsegments%2Fschool%2Fcollections%2F613%3Fpage%3D8\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Перейти</a></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div><div class=\"embla__slide slider-image item\" mbr-style=\"{'margin-left': gap + 'rem', 'margin-right': gap + 'rem'}\">\n                        <div class=\"slide-content\">\n                            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                                <div class=\"item-img\">\n                                    \n                                <a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/26178\" target=\"true\"></a><a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/28444?returnTo=%2Fto-readers%2Fsegments%2Fschool%2Fcollections%2F613%3Fpage%3D7\" target=\"true\"></a><a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/28446?returnTo=%2Fto-readers%2Fsegments%2Fschool%2Fcollections%2F613%3Fpage%3D7\" target=\"true\"></a><a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/27808?returnTo=%2Fto-readers%2Fsegments%2Fschool%2Fcollections%2F613%3Fpage%3D7\" target=\"true\"></a><a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/28111?returnTo=%2Fto-readers%2Fsegments%2Fschool%2Fcollections%2F613%3Fpage%3D7\" target=\"true\"></a><a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/27806?returnTo=%2Fto-readers%2Fsegments%2Fschool%2Fcollections%2F613%3Fpage%3D7\" target=\"true\"></a><a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/26180?returnTo=%2Fto-readers%2Fsegments%2Fschool%2Fcollections%2F613%3Fpage%3D8\" target=\"true\"></a><a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/26183?returnTo=%2Fto-readers%2Fsegments%2Fschool%2Fcollections%2F613%3Fpage%3D8\" target=\"true\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/26183.webp\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" data-slide-to=\"6\" data-bs-slide-to=\"6\"></a></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                                <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>Илии тутуурдаах...: оҕо-эдэр сааhы ахтыы</b></h5>\n                                <h6 class=\"item-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showCardSubtitle\">\n                                    <i>Card Subtitle</i>\n                                </h6>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Автор оҕо-эдэр сылдьан хайдах бултаабытын-алтаабытын ахтар, булт тэрилин арааһын, ону хайдах оҥорору, туттары суруйар</p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"https://nlrs.ru/to-readers/segments/school/open/26183?returnTo=%2Fto-readers%2Fsegments%2Fschool%2Fcollections%2F613%3Fpage%3D8\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Перейти</a></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--prev\">\n                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-prev mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"embla__button embla__button--next\">\n                <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-arrow-next mbr-iconfont\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n                <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
